" Help: status keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
"Actions                                                                                                                 "
" V      select several rows                   /      search                       u     Push and set upstream           "
" j      move down                             n      go to the next match       p       Pull …                          "
" k      move up                               N      go to the previous match     p     Pull                            "
" gg     go to top                             <c-k>  search all commands        f       Fetch …                         "
" G      go to bottom                          ?      show the keys                f     Fetch                           "
" <c-d>  scroll down half a page               q      go back                      a     Fetch all remotes               "
" <c-u>  scroll up half a page                 c      Commit …                   z       Stash …                         "
" m      mark this file or folder as viewed      c    Commit                       z     Stash changes                   "
" <c-n>  jump to the next section                e    Extend                       p     Pop latest stash                "
" <c-p>  jump to the previous section            a    Amend                      C       Change …                        "
" <tab>  fold or unfold the item under the …     w    Reword                       n     New change on top               "
" s      stage file or hunk                    b      Branch …                     e     Edit this change                "
" u      unstage file or hunk                    b    Checkout branch              d     Describe this change            "
" S      stage everything                        c    Create and checkout          s     Squash into its parent          "
" U      unstage everything                      n    Create                       a     Abandon this change             "
" x      discard the changes under the curs…     D    Delete                       u     Undo the last operation         "
" <c-r>  reload                                  p    Pull requests                U     Redo the last undone operation  "
" <cr>   open the item under the cursor          P    Open a pull request        w       Worktree …                      "
" D      review all uncommitted changes        d      Diff against …               w     Open in a tab                   "
" T      change the theme                        d    Base branch                  c     Create with a new branch        "
" o      see CI runs                             c    Last commit                  b     Check out a branch              "
" [      jump to the previous section            b    A branch                     D     Remove                          "
" ]      jump to the next section                s    A commit from the log        l     See the list                    "
" e      open this file in your editor           w    HEAD (working tree)        <a-l>   switch to the next project      "
" <c-g>  edit this text in your editor         l      Log …                      <a-h>   switch to the previous project  "
" gf     find a file in the repository           l    Current branch             <a-n>   add a project as a tab          "
" B      blame this file: see who last chan…     b    All branches               <a-w>   close this project              "
